<title>UK: BNG sets 250 million mark July 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 250 million mark July 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    02.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.765   PAY DATE  L-17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.15	REOFFER    99.84     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 119 DUE MAY 2001</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
